, with $x={[\\begin{aligned}-1,\\,-2,\\,4\\end{aligned}]}^{T},$ we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}\\,f & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530490 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186204087 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "64331ffc-80a5-50c1-a7ac-d346458ce997" :knowledge-point/title "Computing Vector Subset Gradients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "45495e50-52ed-5e9d-807c-4f5e3a31aab2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529742}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "45495e50-52ed-5e9d-807c-4f5e3a31aab2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529742} :answer-field/id #uuid "44f60de3-5df7-5c45-a5ec-0277d8e3d558" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530269} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f99c35a7-6f75-5bdb-9129-00c070a0d173" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f99c35a7-6f75-5bdb-9129-00c070a0d173" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530200} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a76533b-6e8c-5a72-a4b6-eb80a918cca9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530313} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8cd0264f-21a4-5290-97ba-da92c34a8819" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8cd0264f-21a4-5290-97ba-da92c34a8819" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529923} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8addb23-c9ed-56fb-b1ef-56a519c71849" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530352}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8df7d96f-d828-5037-823d-2c01daf4d3bd" :question/math-academy-id "q-264877" :question/problem "Given the function \n$f(x;w)={w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}-{w}_{3}{x}_{3},$\ncompute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$ with the input $x={[\\begin{aligned}3,\\,2,\\,1\\end{aligned}]}^{T}.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"30px\">${∇}_{w}\\,f=\\text{ }$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "To compute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$, we take partial derivatives with respect to each component of $w.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{1}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{1}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}-{w}_{3}{x}_{3})={x}_{1} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{2}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}-{w}_{3}{x}_{3})={x}_{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{3}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{3}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}-{w}_{3}{x}_{3})=-{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, with $x={[\\begin{aligned}3,\\,2,\\,1\\end{aligned}]}^{T},$ we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}\\,f & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530468 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186204087 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "64331ffc-80a5-50c1-a7ac-d346458ce997" :knowledge-point/title "Computing Vector Subset Gradients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e42de53f-e416-5506-922d-21ae84c3ec5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530152}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e42de53f-e416-5506-922d-21ae84c3ec5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530152} :answer-field/id #uuid "0005ae5b-2ef0-5c8f-a025-6a92a8dc741d" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530215} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7520e3b1-f09b-50b4-a7bc-ddf0e9a80eb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529880}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7520e3b1-f09b-50b4-a7bc-ddf0e9a80eb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529880} :answer-field/id #uuid "4f23537f-4ec9-52cb-91e5-af81fc153199" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530275} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04f00061-d0f3-5417-b735-1275d973995d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529586}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04f00061-d0f3-5417-b735-1275d973995d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529586} :answer-fiel